Artwork license
===============

All artwork in this directory (and the JPG renders in src/seed/assets/) is
original work generated by art/build-art.mjs for the Celestial English Golden Retrievers
website. It is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/) — use, modify, and
publish it freely, commercially or otherwise, no attribution required.

The Fraunces typeface rendered inside the artwork is licensed under the SIL
Open Font License 1.1 (free for commercial use, embedding, and rendering).

These images are placeholders: replace them with real photography of the
program's dogs from the admin dashboard (Media collection) at any time.
